080438f0 <flush_cb>:
 * @param px_map        buffer containing pixel data
 * @note                transfers pixel data to the LCD controller using the callbacks 'send_cmd' and 'send_color', which were
 *                      passed to the 'lv_st7789_create()' function
 */
